			(2) The monitoring agency shall submit its report to the issuer in the format specified in Schedule XI  on  a  quarterly  basis,  till  {{^{{FOOTNOTE 174}}}}[hundred  per  cent].  of  the  proceeds  of  the  issue  {{^{{FOOTNOTE 175}}}}[actually raised]{{^{{FOOTNOTE 176}}}}[\*\*\*] have been utilised.
