			(3)    The  {{^{{FOOTNOTE 215}}}}[designated  stock  exchange]  shall  ensure  that  the  monies  received  in  respect  of  the rights  issue  are  released  to  the  issuer  in  compliance  with  the  provisions  of  sub-section  (3)  of section 40 of the Companies Act, 2013, as applicable.
			FOOTNOTE 215
				Substituted by the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Issue of Capital and Disclosure Requirements) (Amendment) Regulations, 2025 w.e.f. 08.04.2025 for the words and symbol “lead manager(s)”. {{^{{FOOTNOTE 216}}}}[Reporting  of  transactions  of  the  promoters  and  promoter  group  and  other  pre-issue
			FOOTNOTE 216
