							More than ten crore rupees, but less than or equal to five thousand crore rupees.
						TC
							0.1 per cent. of the paid-up capital
					TR
						TC
							More than five thousand crore rupees.
						TC
							Five crore rupees ( 5, 00, 00, 000/-) plus 0.025 per cent. of the portion of the paid-up capital in excess of five thousand crore rupees ( 5000, 00, 00, 000/-).
			SUBSEC (d)
				Updation of an offer document:
				TABLE
					TR
						TH

						TH
							Amount / Rate of fees
					TR
						TC
							Where updations or changes are made in any of the sections specified in Para 2 of Schedule XVI of these regulations
						TC
							Ten thousand rupees (`10, 000/-) for updations or changes per section, subject to total fee not exceeding one fourth (1/4th) of the filing fees paid at the time of filing the draft document with the Board or fifty thousand rupees (` 50, 000/-), whichever is higher.
	SUBPART - NOTES
		SEC (1)
			Where  the  issue  size  is  not  determinable  at  the  time  of  submission  of  the  draft  offer document  or  the  offer  document  in  case  of  a  fast  track  issue,  the  issuer  shall  pay  fees mentioned at para (2), based on the estimated issue size.
		SEC (2)
			If the issue size estimated by the issuer differs from the eventual issue size and thereby:–
			SUBSEC (a)
				the  fees  paid  by  the  issuer  is  deficient,  the  balance  fee  shall  be  paid  by  the  issuer within seven days of  finalisation of the basis of allotment; or
			SUBSEC (b)
				the fees paid by the issuer is in excess, excess fee shall be refunded by the Board to the issuer.
