			Details  of  the  key  managerial  personnel  {{^{{FOOTNOTE 660}}}}[and  senior  management] indicating name, date of joining, qualification, term of office  with  date of expiration  of  term  and  details  of  service  contracts  including termination/retirement benefits, if any, details of previous employment, etc.
