			SUBSEC (5)
				The fact that the issuer or any of its promoters or directors is a  {{^{{FOOTNOTE 694}}}}[wilful defaulter or  a  fraudulent  borrower]  shall  be  disclosed  prominently  on  the  cover  page  with suitable cross-referencing to the inside pages.
