			SUBSEC (13)
				Financial  Performance  of  the  Issuing  company  for  the  last  three  years  (Figures  to  be taken from the audited annual accounts in a tabular form):
		SEC (a)
			Balance Sheet Data: Equity Capital, Reserves (State Revaluation Reserve, the year of revaluation and its monetary effect on assets) and borrowings
		SEC (b)
			Profit and Loss data: Sales, Gross profit, Net profit, dividend paid, if any
		SEC (c)
			Any change in accounting policies during the last three years and their effect on the profits and the reserves of the issuing company
		SEC (d)
			Following information as extracted from the report of the auditors reproduced in the main prospectus:
				PARA (i)
					net profit before accounting for extra ordinary items
