	SUBPART - FILING OF UPDATED OFFER DOCUMENT
	SUBPART - [See regulation 25(6) {{^{{FOOTNOTE 775}}}}{59E (3)}, {{^{{FOOTNOTE 776}}}}[\*\*\*] 123(6) and 186(5)]
		FOOTNOTE 775
